<div class="dashboard-welcome">
	<h1>Valeria's site, behind the scenes</h1>
	<p class="dashboard-subtitle">A real estate site in English and Spanish. A few things to try:</p>
	<p><strong>Sell a home.</strong> Open <a href="collections/listings/214-linden-hollow-lane">214 Linden Hollow Lane</a>, set Status to Sold and add a Sold Price and Date. Watch it move on the home page, the search and San Carlos's page.</p>
	<p><strong>Import homes from a CSV file.</strong> <a href="collections/listings/-import">Import</a> on Listings takes <a href="/media/listings-sample.csv" download>listings-sample.csv</a>, the kind of export other brokerages send.</p>
	<p><strong>Send the Just-listed email.</strong> In the <a href="mailer">Mailer</a>, Just Listed goes to everyone on the list with Bulk Send, each in their own language.</p>
	<p><strong>Make a home private.</strong> Turn on Private on any listing, and only buyers on the private list see it.</p>
	<p><strong>The A/B test.</strong> The home page shows half its visitors a seller-first version. Set <code>abPercent</code> on the Home page in Site Builder to pick one.</p>
	<p>The full tour, and what to change before handing the site over, is at <a href="/readme" target="_blank">/readme</a>.</p>
</div>
